== Behavior ==
A '''Wolf''' will run towards the player and jump at them. They will deal {{Stat|dmg|90}} on contact with the player.

== Bestiary ==
{{Bestiary Entry|section=Hub|lore=Roaming the remains of a Castle far from its best days.|bracket=3|max_tier=15}}

== Trivia ==
* Wolves can also be leashed and taken around the [[Hub Island]]. This was a commonly used strategy for fighting [[Sven Packmaster]]s in [[Slayer]] Quests, as the final Wolves needed to spawn the boss can be led to and killed in the pond near the {{Zone|Mountain}}.
*If a Wolf is taken to the edge of the {{Zone|Ruins}} it will no longer be aggressive towards players.

